# =============================================================================
# .gitattributes
# =============================================================================
# This repo's toolchain (bash, terraform, tfsec, podman) is Linux-only --
# WSL2 and CI both read these files as LF. Without this file, Windows git's
# core.autocrlf=true silently re-flips the whole tree to CRLF on every
# checkout/pull, which WSL2's git (no autocrlf) then sees as fully modified
# and which can break bash scripts outright (CRLF after a shebang, or inside
# a `set -o pipefail`-style option string). Confirmed recurring across
# multiple sessions -- this pins LF for real instead of renormalizing by
# hand each time it resurfaces.
# =============================================================================
* text=auto eol=lf
